  "body": "Various sites have a feature where a thumbnail (or a series of thumbnails) is shown above the seekbar of a video, so you know what you're seeking to before you actually seek. @eric-carlson had a plenary session at TPAC about how to do this in a good way, for both the native controls and for exposing the necessary bits to JS to implement these interfaces for custom controls.\n\nSee http://www.w3.org/2016/09/21-thumb-minutes.html for the discussion.\n",
